Well, finally a fews months after ascending my first monk in nethack (and
only ascencion so far), I've managed to ascend slash'em too.

During this time, I've strat playing slash'em, beginning with doppelganger
monks (best was petrified by a basilisk at DL27) and then a few random
slash'em and nethack game (a nethack Valk died on Fire). Another slash'em
doppelganger monk died on my first meeting ever with Demogorgon.

Lastly, a random character generation gave me a monk, so I went for
doppelganger neutral female for the rest, to have good chances.

early game was both lucky and unlucky. An altar at DL4 and mall at DL5
allow me to go for Soko first. Lots of spellbook (and usefull ones, too)
were found early (id, charm monster, finger of death, polymorph, enchant
*). But I did not find any scroll of id before mine's end (catacomb) ! My
first id when for diamond and emerald and the shopkeepers did the rest of
the job for me.

Soko had amulet and BoH was upgraded (or found in the Mines, can't
remember... in the middle game I had 4 spare BoH inmy stash).

Then, I turn twice into a Xorn to rob a huge potion shop at DL7 and what
was left in the general shop of the mall. Leaving two angry shopkeepers
preventing me from going upward...

Midgame was going down as fast as possible. Locating portal to lawfull
quest and the QUest. The altar in the quest allowed me to alchemise 17
full healing, drinking 10 right now and going down to say a word to Master
Kaen.

The, down and down again in the hope of finding a convertible altar,
leaving two temporary stashes in differents levels.

DL 26 had the portal to the black market, which I quickly robbed of
everything. Nymphs were alredy found, with a lot of chests.

DL29 finally had a convertible altar. The angry god send 3 marilith,
killing 2 but the third summoned a fourth one and Juiblex. Well, let
think... stethoscope. Juiblex is meditating, OK, kill the mariliths. J. is
still meditating. OK, go and meditate about this chained blitz. You killed
Juiblex. Good.

Founding the stairs down, I quickly went for a look at DL30. The downstair
room had *both* an altar (co-aligned) and a foutain. OK, right.

Organizing a big stash at DL30, with many, many chests from nymphs to hold
everything by categories. Identification, enchantement, all my gear was +5
and AK-worth (Whisperfeet, gauntlets of defense, T-shirt, cloak of
protection, HoB and later robe of power). Two magic lamps only gave me one
wish (eye of the tapioca) and 20 or so smokies (see inv, second best
choice after fruit juice imho) only gave me a tame djinn... Augh !

Alchemy raised my HP around 350 and I went further down.

Finally found Medusa and cleaned the Castle with the help of my pets. The
wand was 0:3 but I did not have any use of it right now (I could almost go
wishless, but with all my spells I really wanted the Eye (plus it's backup
MR)).

When up to clean the quests after genociding L and h. A throne allowed me
to also genocide disenchanters.

Then back in the Valley. I had 2 black dragon and a vampire mage as pets
and let them do the dirty job.

The big D. was the fourth of the first bunch of named demons, a single
potion of paralysis gave me enough time to kill him (of course, a previous
wand of draining remove my skill in healing, thus giving me a high failure
rate in cure sickness instead of the previous 0% and I had to rely on my
unihorn to do the trick...)

Then down and down in hell, charming a few olog-ai from time to time. The
3 last named demon asked for a total of around 500 golds which I happily
gave them since I did'nt want to chase them all around the level.

The VB level was cloudy, making it much more easier to find the square by
simply patrolling all over the level.

Then back to Rodney (Vlad was already dead). Confused taming in his zoo,
wand of digging on his tower and then wand of death on him. Not dead ?
Again. Rodney is "unaffected". Ouch ! Is he death-protected in slash'em ?
(answer below). Kill him with my bare hands, take the book.

Down to the VB, invocation. Down in the sanctum with a vampire mage and a
few dragons, conflict plus a wand of fireball quickly cleaned the
graveyard.

Rodney showed up in the sanctum itself and doubletroubled, my wand of
death was still innefective on him. So I punched out the priest, let
Rodney took the amulet and my Eyes and went back chasing him. On the upper
level, I gave another unsucceful attend of wand of death, then remember
that it should be empty (it was Orcus' one, pick it up 0:4) and that I
should swap for my spare one.

And realize that I had always used it by it's (normal) inventory letter,
and for some reason I had not performed the right adjustment at the right
time and was trying to dig Rodney... Augh. Zapped the real wand of death
and killed him.

Rodney did not show agan in hell. At DL30 I made a quick pause to retrive
a few more gear. Among other stuff, my 20 potions of holy water (somehow I
realized after killing Rodney the first time that I had forgotten all of
them in my stash (except for 2 in my sack of emergency)).

Then running up, Rodney showed up but was quickly killed with a single zap
of wand of death.

Before entering the Planes, I tried to apply a figurine of ruby golem
found in hell, it turn out hostile, so I wished for a solar and got it.

Plans were rather easy, with free action and levitation. Water was rather
troublesome since I did not come any closer to the portal and had to
re-read a scroll of gold detection because it has moved a long way. During
this boredom, I wished for blessed geno and wiped ; (almost useles, but an
accident happens quickly).

On Astral, I was on the right and Death too, so I went in the middle
(Pestilence). My Solar killed Pestilence (twice actually, but I only
witnessed the first one) and conflict + wand of teleport make me a quick
way to the altar. The altar room was only occupied by a Vampire and...
aneutral priest. OK, priest, get out of that high-altar right now !

You ascend the status of demigod.

